    <node id="Incremental Update Algorithm">
      <data key="d0">Incremental Update Algorithm</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A process for updating the knowledge base with new data without full reprocessing&lt;SEP&gt;A method ensuring timely integration of new data into the indexed structure of LightRAG to maintain effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Incremental Update Algorithm is a process that ensures timely integration of new data into the LightRAG system, maintaining its effectiveness in dynamic environments.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-001</data>
