    <node id="Electric Vehicle">
      <data key="d0">Electric Vehicle</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Electric Vehicle refers to a vehicle powered by electricity, often discussed in the context of urban air quality and public transportation infrastructure.</data>
