    </node>
    <node id="RQ-RAG">
      <data key="d0">RQ-RAG</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A retrieval-augmented generation system that serves as a baseline for comparison, emphasizing query reformulation.&lt;SEP&gt;An approach leveraging an LLM to decompose input queries into multiple sub-queries using techniques like rewriting, decomposition, and disambiguation to enhance search accuracy.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-005</data>
