      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Indigenous perspectives emphasize communal rights to land and resources, spiritual connections to the environment, and collaborative approaches over competition in corporate mergers.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-012</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
