    <edge source="GraphRAG" target="LightRAG">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">LightRAG reduces overhead compared to GraphRAG by focusing on retrieving entities and relationships instead of text chunks.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG consistently outperforms GraphRAG, particularly in larger datasets with complex language contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG is compared against GraphRAG as a baseline method across datasets and evaluation dimensions.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG outperforms GraphRAG in comprehensive information retrieval, particularly in larger datasets with complex language contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG is compared with GraphRAG in terms of token usage, API calls, and efficiency in retrieval and incremental updates.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG contrasts with GraphRAG by integrating new entities and relationships without full reconstruction, demonstrating superior efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d9">comparison,contrasts,efficiency,evaluation,improves upon,performance comparison,reduces overhead compared to,retrieval mechanism,superior,superiority</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68c5b57fc5e4f80b4481763ee3f107c6-chunk-005</data>
